## Third-party names

Some deck titles name a vendor exam or a programming language (for example
AWS SAA-C03, C#). Those names are used descriptively to identify the study
material. RecallSmith is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by any of
those vendors, and it is not an official exam simulator.

## How to add an asset

1. Put the file in the correct directory under `mobile/assets/`.
2. Add a row here (for art) or in `mobile/assets/sfx/LICENSES.md` (for audio).
3. Never commit audio under CC-BY-NC, CC-BY-SA, "free for personal use", or an
   unknown licence.
4. Record Sonniss GDC-bundle files as "Sonniss royalty-free (GDC bundle licence)",
   not CC0.
